  "description": "A Redis pub/sub backplane for ASP.NET Core apps built with Rask: `AddRaskRedisBackplane()` carries IBroadcast messages between the instances behind a load balancer, so a publish on one server re-renders the subscribed pages on every server. Only topics declared with a source-generated JsonTypeInfo cross hosts; the rest stay in-process.",
